 primarily due to employee stock option exercises, which were unusually high, related in large part to existing employees following our restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/08/etsy-etsy-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call-transcr.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2018 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2018-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"We've seen no significant increase in seller churn, we aren't seeing price increases being passed along to our buyers and we've substantially increased our investment in the business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/etsy-inc-etsy-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2018 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2018-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rachel Glaser","x":"From the first phase of our migration to Google Cloud, to the launch of our price increase, to the smooth integration of DaWanda buyers and sellers to our marketplace, our team is consistently and tenaciously delivering on our goals.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/etsy-inc-etsy-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2018 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2018-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"In Q3, we began to streamline the purchase flow for orders that are personalized or customized.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/etsy-inc-etsy-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2018 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2018-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rachel Glaser","x":"G&A decreased due to reduced headcount and restructuring charges last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/11/06/etsy-inc-etsy-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2018 Q4","e":"etsy","d":"2019-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"As you know, one of our goals following our price increase was to test various new marketing channels to determine which of them could potentially increase awareness, frequency, and help make Etsy more top-of-mind among both active and new buyers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/25/etsy-inc-etsy-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2018 Q4","e":"etsy","d":"2019-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Thomas Forte","x":"One is when you raised price last year in the second half of the year, you talked about how you were going to invest all the incremental dollars.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/25/etsy-inc-etsy-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2019 Q1","e":"etsy","d":"2019-05-08","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"And then to streamline that process so that it's easier for the buyer to say what they want the personalization to be and the seller to incorporate that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/09/etsy-inc-etsy-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2019 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rachel Glaser","x":"First, marketplace revenue benefited from 21% GMS growth and the related transaction revenue also benefiting from last year's price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/etsy-inc-etsy-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2019 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2019-08-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"To the extent that that's on the Google Shopping side, that's still a pass-through, but again, over time, we think Etsy Ads has real margin-accretive value to Etsy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/etsy-inc-etsy-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2019 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2019-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"I think, when we're increasing our guidance, how do we break down the components?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/02/etsy-inc-etsy-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2019 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"In 2017, our team reorganized to prioritize fast execution, streamlining and focusing on the areas of the business that have the highest probability of driving GMS growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/etsy-inc-etsy-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2019 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rachel Glaser","x":"Turning to our outlook, we are raising guidance for 2019 GMS growth to 25% to 26% approximately $4.9 billion to $5 billion and revenue growth to 34% to 35% approximately $809 million to $815 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/etsy-inc-etsy-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2020 Q1","e":"etsy","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Deb Wasser","x":"And what are some of the places you plan to continue to lean into and where will you be seeing cost savings?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/07/etsy-inc-etsy-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2020 Q1","e":"etsy","d":"2020-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rachel Glaser","x":"So a lot more of our product development team has expensed through our P&L. So those are the I know your question was specifically about cost reduction, and we've been judicious where we can, but also keep in mind those other puts and takes that impact our bottom line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/07/etsy-inc-etsy-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2020 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2020-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rachel Glaser","x":"It's not at 100% pass-through of cost though.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/etsy-inc-etsy-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2020 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2020-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"And we're doing a better job of streamlining what's the information that needs to be on the page and what information is extraneous or distracting.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/05/etsy-inc-etsy-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ETSY 2020 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rachel Glaser","x":"Recently, our teams have developed new initiatives, including improved shop recommendations to get sellers to their first sale more quickly, helping sellers to scale and investing in member support operations to optimize and streamline issue resolution.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/etsy-inc-etsy-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2021 Q1","e":"etsy","d":"2021-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joshua Silverman","x":"…deep learning models to expand the number of candidates of a 100 million items picking the right small set that are actually appropriate from which you can then rank from one to 500 is actually a big part of that task, that first pass through the 100 million listings to find the right candidates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/etsy-inc-etsy-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2021 Q1","e":"etsy","d":"2021-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joshua Silverman","x":"So a focus for this year is going to be even more specifically highlighting and showcasing items that can be personalized and customized as well as streamlining that process of co-creation between the buyer and the seller.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/06/etsy-inc-etsy-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2021 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2021-08-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Rachel Glaser","x":"And Reverb actually took a price increase last year as well, which helps keep the former consolidated Etsy take rate high.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/04/etsy-inc-etsy-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2021 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2021-11-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joshua Silverman","x":"So, we're working closely with them looking at, for example, their search technology to figure out how we can deliver more relevant search experiences, and things that streamline the path to purchase so people can go from view to purchase even faster and more easily.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/04/etsy-inc-etsy-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2024 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2024-10-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"Here's our new hero brand spot for TV, streaming, and YouTube, which shines a spotlight on what makes our sellers so magical. [Video Presentation] The team and I couldn't be more excited about the changes we've made and how we're telling the world about them.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/etsy-etsy-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2024 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2024-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"A key foundation of the discovery and engagement work I've discussed today has been powered by our investments in AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/etsy-etsy-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2024 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2024-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"I think the more we can do to emphasize the humanity of Etsy and the Etsy seller, the artisanal craft role that was played, the more we can give the seller her rightful pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/etsy-etsy-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2024 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2024-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Josh Silverman","x":"So you really understand how artisanal the item is and that I think is going to really support our sellers and their pricing power.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/22/etsy-etsy-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2024 Q4","e":"etsy","d":"2025-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joshua G. Silverman","x":"I'm sure we'll get a question about tariffs at some point in this call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/19/etsy-etsy-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2024 Q4","e":"etsy","d":"2025-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joshua G. Silverman","x":"The short answer is it really depends because we're seeing all kinds of proposals and it's very difficult right now to know which tariffs, on which countries, will de minimis be allowed or not in those regimes, it's really hard to know.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/19/etsy-etsy-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2025 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2025-07-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Joshua G. Silverman","x":"And we'll have dramatically shifted to OTT, audio, digital video and other streaming platforms, which will represent about 65% of our Q4 brand spend, up from about 40% a year ago.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/etsy-etsy-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2025 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2025-07-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Joshua G. Silverman","x":"We have not seen any big shifts in spending across those related to tariffs or trade announcements that have happened.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/21/etsy-etsy-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2025 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2025-10-29","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Kruti Goyal","x":"As we've told you, we're significantly reallocating our brand marketing spend away from linear TV into upper funnel channels intended to spark engagement and inspiration such as social video and streaming.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/etsy-etsy-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2025 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Charles Baker","x":"On the tariff and trade lane front, we experienced some pressure on our U.S. import trade route during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/etsy-etsy-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2025 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Charles Baker","x":"While we remain cautious about the potential impact of tariffs and trade restrictions, especially on consumer discretionary expenditures, we are encouraged by Etsy's resilience and responsiveness thus far.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/etsy-etsy-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2025 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Joshua Silverman","x":"At this time, we are not passing that through to our sellers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/27/etsy-etsy-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2025 Q4","e":"etsy","d":"2026-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Charles Baker","x":"Average order value has been up with inflation, with probably some tariff input, certainly, FX input has lifted the average order value.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/19/etsy-etsy-q4-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2025 Q4","e":"etsy","d":"2026-02-19","l":"ai_disruption","r":"analyst","s":"Shweta Khajuria","x":"One is -- both are on the longer-term side, on agentic commerce, a follow-up, much of the drawdown that we've seen in Internet stocks year-to-date is in part because of this concern that some of these business models could be disrupted with the AI agents and what they can do.","url":"https://www.