4-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Charles Baker","x":"Those increases are probably sticky price increases, but they -- we will lap the benefit of sellers having taken that up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/29/etsy-etsy-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2026 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2026-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Charles Baker","x":"And the one other shift is moving away from like linear and some of the older television or video advertising that we've done toward more targeted streaming and services like that has helped us go after the right audience.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/etsy-etsy-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2026 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Charles Baker","x":"On the hosting and compute side, what we are spending more money this year, obviously, on AI and on usage of AI and on compute.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/etsy-etsy-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2026 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2026-08-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Charles Baker","x":"On AOV, what we've seen over the last, call it, year, year plus is the effect of the tariffs that went in a year ago and then the expiration of de minimis and then getting through the holiday season, and sellers seeming to kind of readjust their pricing led to a series of waves of increases in…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/etsy-etsy-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2026 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kruti Goyal","x":"So we're announcing a restructuring of parts of our organization and a reduction of our workforce with most of the changes concentrated in our product and engineering group.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/etsy-etsy-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2026 Q2","e":"etsy","d":"2026-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Kruti Goyal","x":"This is not a cost-cutting move.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/etsy-etsy-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2026 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2026-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Lanny Baker","x":"At the start of 2026, the large portion of our growth was coming from what we kind of deemed external factors, which would be the effect of inflation and tariffs on listing prices, currency exchange rates that were going in our favor at that time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/etsy-etsy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2026 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lanny Baker","x":"Strong revenue growth, together with the impact of our restructuring in August, translated into adjusted EBITDA of $210 million, growing 14.6% year-over-year and representing a 30.4% adjusted EBITDA margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/etsy-etsy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2026 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Lanny Baker","x":"Excluding restructuring charges, product development expense gained leverage year-over-year, reflecting lower stock-based compensation and employee-related expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/etsy-etsy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ETSY 2026 Q3","e":"etsy","d":"2026-10-28","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Kruti Patel Goyal","x":"The point is that AI should support seller creativity and not replace it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/etsy-etsy-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,7395,0,0,0,6743,443],[34,1,9361,0,0,0,8364,656],[35,1,7276,0,0,0,6309,591],[36,1,9692,0,0,0,7498,1533],[37,1,11349,0,0,0,9189,1546],[38,1,10795,0,0,0,8978,1349],[39,1,1106